[00:25.92]Mankind has stumbled for centuries in darkness.
[00:32.06]Vain is their quest as they try to catch the wind.
[00:38.18]Man’s tragic flaw is revealed in its starkness;
[00:44.48]None can they save, for they all have sinned.
[00:50.87](Chorus)
[00:51.02]Sing with good cheer, for God’s Kingdom is here!
[01:02.32]His Son’s mighty reign brings us freedom from fear.
[01:08.90]Through him, at last, evil soon will be past;
[01:14.70]This hope, like an anchor, is holding us fast.
[01:46.11]“God’s day is near!” rings the Kingdom proclamation;
[01:51.67]Men will no longer cry out to God: “How long?”
[01:57.50]Soon he will free all his groaning creation.
[02:04.00]Praise God Almighty, and join our song.
[02:19.03](Chorus)
[02:19.18]Sing with good cheer, for God’s Kingdom is here!
[02:25.42]His Son’s mighty reign brings us freedom from fear.
[02:32.06]Through him, at last, evil soon will be past;
[02:37.74]This hope, like an anchor, is holding us fast.
